{
  "id": "c1-e18-feeding-the-world",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Feeding the world",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how has your diet changed over the years?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how important is food in your culture?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think about where your food comes from?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, would you be willing to change what you eat to help the environment?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e18-a1",
            "c1-e18-a2",
            "c1-e18-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show different aspects of food. Choose two of the pictures and say what problems might be connected with providing food, and how people might be affected.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these issues do you think is the most urgent?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e18-b1",
            "c1-e18-b2",
            "c1-e18-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people dealing with too much or too little food. Choose two of the pictures and say what has led to these situations, and what could be done about them.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, what do you think is the best way to reduce food waste?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways to ensure that there is enough food for a growing population, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e18-feeding-the-world",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these approaches help to feed the world in the future?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6900
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e18-feeding-the-world",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most important?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about food security and diets.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it realistic to expect people to change their diets for the good of the planet?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should governments control what food companies produce?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think genetically modified crops are the answer to world hunger?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Why is so much food wasted in wealthy countries?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, could cities realistically produce a large part of their own food?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should supermarkets be forced to give away unsold food?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e18-feeding-the-world/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
